{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんばんは"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "愛知県出身 21歳の岡本姫奈です。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日は必ずブログを書こうって決めてたんです！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ちょうど1年前の今日 ｢相対性理論に異議を唱える｣のMVが公開されました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "センターに選んでいただいた日\n泣きながら家族に電話したし"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "マネージャーさんが泣いて喜んでくれて。\n同期のみんなが抱きついてお祝いしてくれたのが嬉しくて。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ファンの皆さんの反応を思い出す度に今でも胸がいっぱいになります。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "当時の景色が 今でも鮮明に焼き付いています😭"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202512/mobUfPYLj.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "🔗 https://youtu.be/vcp7XKBylkM?si=0yTbHDRj7dJCagFO"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私はこのMVが本当に大好きで、何度も何度も見返してます笑\n心のお守りのような存在です。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "朝起きて、YouTube を開くたびに増えていく再生回数がとても嬉しくて、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "本当にありがとう。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "沢山の方に愛していただけた楽曲になって\n感謝の気持ちでいっぱいです😭"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "皆さんの前で披露できる日が待ち遠しいです🩰"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最後まで読んでいただきありがとうございました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最近は舞台のお稽古も始まって、初めてのことばかりの毎日です。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "不安もあるけれど、\n龍賀沙代ちゃんとして必死で頑張ります！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202512/mob5vbBEc.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202512/mobqw6oSY.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "おやすみ〜♡"}], "source": "official"}